## STEP 52 — Scope Bypass Red-Team Suite

Actively try to break ScopePolicy.

Test at minimum:

* `127.0.0.1.evil.com`
* decimal/hex/octal IP representations
* IPv6 loopback
* IPv4-mapped IPv6
* localhost DNS aliases
* username/password URL confusion
* redirect chains
* URL fragments
* encoded hostnames
* trailing dots
* IDN/punycode
* alternate ports
* scheme changes
* HTTP → HTTPS
* HTTPS → HTTP
* WebSocket redirects
* browser navigation to external origins
* DNS resolution changing between validation and request

The scanner must fail closed.

