## STEP 57 — Workflow Engine Real E2E

Unit tests are not enough.

Run real workflow integration tests against the vulnerable demo application.

Verify separately:

### BOLA write workflow

* User A creates disposable object.
* User B modifies/reads it.
* Proof is generated.
* Cleanup succeeds.

### Stored XSS workflow

* Store harmless canary.
* Browser renders it.
* Runtime execution is verified.
* Test content is deleted.

### Upload workflow

* Upload harmless file.
* Read as owner.
* Attempt cross-user access.
* Verify behavior.
* Delete artifact.

### Session workflow

* Login.
* Fingerprint session without storing value.
* Logout.
* Verify invalidation.
* Login again.
* Verify rotation.

Test cleanup after intentional failures too.

