## STEP 58 — Auth Identity Integrity Audit

Prove that two configured test users are genuinely different identities.

Test:

* identical cookies accidentally supplied twice
* two sessions belonging to same account
* expired session
* redirected-to-login session
* partially authenticated session
* role mismatch
* context name mismatch
* authentication refresh during scan

Authorization tests must stop if identity separation cannot be proven.

Never generate BOLA findings from ambiguous identity contexts.

