## STEP 64 — Remote Target Ownership Flow

Current registry models DNS TXT and well-known verification, but automated flows are minimal.

Implement real verification flows.

### DNS TXT

Generate challenge:

```text
_magic-security.example.com
magic-security-verification=<token>
```

Resolve and verify it.

### Well-known

Verify:

```text
https://example.com/.well-known/magic-security-verification.txt
```

containing the expected token.

Support:

* verification
* expiration
* re-verification
* suspension

Do not enable remote active scanning before successful verification.

